A valid yaml fragment for an local path file provider that uses a template
for the path. The path coming from the value being invalid should not
affect templating.

-- config.yaml --
kind: relative_path
path: "{{ some_path }}"

-- values --
some_path: "not/a/valid/path"

-- after-templating --
kind: relative_path
path: "not/a/valid/path"
